    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if a powerful wizard wanted to build a zoo for all kinds of different fantasy animals? In Fantasy Zoo you can build your own zoo for many unique creatures. Instead of normal animals like elephants or lions fill your zoo with monsters like dragons and griffins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your animals happy by building good enclosures for them and offer them food and shelter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some animals are dangerous, you need to make their enclosures strong enough. Prevent escape by building strong walls or blocking their access to weak walls with barricades or other objects, use magic to keep flying animals at ground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951060/extras/07be1c41b2eedf9b0293700a58cf3fbf.avif?t=1751963305\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use thematic tools to manage and build the zoo. Move things by teleporting and stop dangerous animals from rampaging with ice spell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951060/extras/6e04da9b201bb316a61e9a6159ffa1ab.poster.avif?t=1751963305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951060/extras/6e04da9b201bb316a61e9a6159ffa1ab.webm?t=1751963305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951060/extras/6e04da9b201bb316a61e9a6159ffa1ab.mp4?t=1751963305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mana</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use magical crystals to prevent animals from escaping and have other utility effects. Simple mana mechanic limits the spell usage and is required as upkeep for the crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Light Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fantasy Zoo offers light gold management. Keep your guests happy for gold income. Choose from different workers and think about costs before getting new animals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple combat mechanic makes the escaping animals dangerous. Stop escaping animals with spells and the zoo staff, or let them rampage and enjoy the mayhem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951060/extras/06ac51f1228d5ce0b2b36a480b4608ea.poster.avif?t=1751963305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951060/extras/06ac51f1228d5ce0b2b36a480b4608ea.webm?t=1751963305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951060/extras/06ac51f1228d5ce0b2b36a480b4608ea.mp4?t=1751963305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Current content and features.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">18 animals </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 different environments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Researchtree for progression mode and challenges to guide progression. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple combat mechanic for escaped animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple unique mechanics for animals such as flying and petrifying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple pylons for magical effects</p></li></ul>",
